### Пользователь
POST http://localhost:8080/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Иван",
  "email": "ivan@example.com",
  "role": "SENDER"
}

### Отправление
POST http://localhost:8080/api/shipments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "senderId": 1,
  "address": "ул. Ленина, 1",
  "weight": 2.5,
  "status": "CREATED"
}

### Маршрут
POST http://localhost:8080/api/routes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "routeDate": "2026-10-16",
  "maxWeight": 10,
  "status": "PLANNED"
}

### Остановка
POST http://localhost:8080/api/stops
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "routeId": 1,
  "address": "ул. Ленина, 1",
  "sequenceNumber": 1
}

### Назначение
POST http://localhost:8080/api/shipment-assignments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "shipmentId": 1,
  "stopId": 1,
  "status": "PENDING"
}

### Список отправлений
GET http://localhost:8080/api/shipments

### Маршрут с расчётом массы
GET http://localhost:8080/api/routes/1
